   "kind": "quote",
   "used_in": [
    "reflect.0"
   ],
   "text": "실행 중에도 LLM 반성기가 현재 행동을 계속 평가",
   "quote": "While the executor acts, the LLM-based reflector continuously evaluates the current action"
  },
