   "kind": "quote",
   "used_in": [
    "compare.1"
   ],
   "text": "사전 계획기는 8.5, 근처 물건은 놓침",
   "quote": "it achieves a higher total value of 8.5. However, nearby objects may be neglected"
  },
  {
   "id": "c41",
   "kind": "quote",
   "used_in": [
    "compare.2"
   ],
   "text": "반성기 조언으로 가까운 66번을 먼저",
   "quote": "prompting the agent to pick up a nearby Object 66 before moving to the opposite side of the room"
  },
  {
   "id": "c42",
   "kind": "quote",
   "used_in": [
    "compare.2"
   ],
   "text": "이 장면에서 RRARA가 가장 좋음",
   "quote": "RRARA achieves the best overall performance in this scenario"
  },
  {
   "id": "c43",
